                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Great art style, and good gameplay. A simple, fast paced linear arcade runner game. I had a lot of fun with this game, would recommend. However, the only flaw is the short amount of content. At the time of posting I have finished the main arcade levels, but there is more than 1 hour of gameplay for anyone concerned as there are multiple dificulty levels and the game is very replayable. Overall I would recommend.",
